core_boundary_ledger
  issue 918
  boundary "docs/design/minimal-core-boundary.md"
  source_file_count_max 53
  source_lines_max 20826
  outside_core_file_count_max 51
  outside_core_lines_max 19896
  note "Issue #1138 B9, plan 09 leaf 1 corrected the four handlers outside rust/src/solver_handlers. Plan 08 promoted the generic verifiable-task interpreter; the URL parsing split adds one recursively counted source but its structural parser reads language evidence from seed roles, so it is promoted core machinery rather than migration debt. Plan 09 leaf 17 registered the M2 retrieval interpreter as a component beside the census. Plan 09 leaf 18 retired the concept-lookup orchestration into rust/src/concepts.rs and the network, refresh, learn and conflict procedures into rust/src/retrieval_procedures.rs, lowering the dispatcher module and the two line ceilings by the same 350 lines. The leaf 18 landing then rebased the census on the committed tree: the verifiable-task interpreter that plan 08 promoted landed at 834 lines, not the 750 first recorded, because its derive family (flow signs, role offsets, unit conversion) that lowers seed-declared expectations into ProgramIr candidates grew past the early estimate; the dispatcher module settled at 582 lines after the 350-line retirement, and seven lines left the reviewed core outside the census, so both ceilings track the honest counts. Re-measured 2026-09-20 after the issue #1021 routing fix (e4f0b3ac4) and plan 09 leaf 41 (12aa51b29) landed with the ledger unrefreshed: solver_handler_how.rs gained the honest-gap and mutating-request precedence arms, solver_handler_units.rs and solver_handlers/pattern_inference.rs grew their seed-driven rules, for 72 net lines; both ceilings now record the measured 20439 and 19456 rather than the stale 20367 and 19384.Re-measured 2026-09-21 for the plan 16 L1 three-source-roots move; the crate sits under rust/ and every ledger path moved with it, the calendar-create split and the previously unledgered policy_gates.rs raise source_file_count_max to 53, eleven baselines re-record the measured tree, and ledgering the two previously uncounted rows raises both line ceilings to 20787 and 19857 with outside_core_file_count_max at 51.Re-measured 2026-09-22 after the recognition and routing batches landed with the ledger unrefreshed: calendar_create.rs gained the elliptical arm and clock-hour role of the entity-grounded hours work, conversation_summary.rs gained empty-history ownership so a summarize request never falls through ownerless, and software_project.rs gained its routing retirement, for 39 net lines; both ceilings record the measured 20826 and 19896."
  component retrieval_method_interpreter
    file rust/src/retrieval_method.rs
    kind "Generic interpreter"
    reason "One retrieval procedure over data/seed/sources-registry.lino: resolve the prompt's unknown subject from the lexicon, consult the sources the registry declares for the need, read the capture cache or fetch, and render with provenance from the seed template. It embeds no domain vocabulary, no canned answer and no routing rule, so it passes the promotion test as a generic interpreter, not a handler; the M2 migration leaves retire the retrieval handlers into it."
